    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">复购</div><div class="num">★★★★★</div><div class="desc">吃完就惦记</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">成本利润</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>卖价</span><span class="v">15元/个</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>成本（原料）</span><span class="v">6元/个</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>单个利润</span><span class="v" style="color:#C0392B">9元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销40个日利润</span><span class="v">360元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销60个日利润</span><span class="v">540元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销80个日利润</span><span class="v">720元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>月固定开销</span><span class="v">约1500元</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>设备投入</span><span class="v">约800-1200元</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-top:6px">回本周期</div>
  <div class="roi">
    <div class="roi-b c"><div>保守</div><div class="d">7天</div><div>日销40个</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b n"><div>正常</div><div class="d">4天</div><div>日销60个</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b i"><div>理想</div><div class="d">3天</div><div>日销80个</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目风险</div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>裹粉手法</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">鳞片要压出来才好看</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>鸡排大小不一</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">进货时挑大小均匀的</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>汉堡坯供应</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">找好稳定供货商不断档</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>出餐速度</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">高峰期提前炸好鸡排</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>竞品跟风</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">品质做深建立口碑护城河</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">启动清单</div>
  <div class="launch">
    <span>电炸炉（加深单缸）350元</span>
    <span>煎扒炉（加热汉堡坯）200元</span>
    <span>不锈钢腌料盆 50元</span>
    <span>食品夹+漏勺 35元</span>
    <span>油温温度计 20元</span>
    <span>电子秤 30元</span>
    <span>保温展示柜 300元</span>
    <span>汉堡纸/纸袋 0.2元/个</span>
    <span>折叠桌+灯箱招牌 150元</span>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44">
    <span><strong>总投入：</strong>约1135元</span>
    <span><strong>占地：</strong>1.5m摊位</span>
    <span><strong>人员：</strong>1-2人</span>
    <span><strong>上手：</strong>3天</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">适合场景</div>
  <div class="scene-grid">
    <span class="scene-item">学校门口</span>
    <span class="scene-item">夜市</span>
    <span class="scene-item">商业街</span>
    <span class="scene-item">步行街</span>
    <span class="scene-item">地铁口</span>
    <span class="scene-item">美食广场</span>
    <span class="scene-item">公园门口</span>
    <span class="scene-item">写字楼周边</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">搭配销售</div>
  <div class="dpair">
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">韩式年糕</div><div class="price">8元/份</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">可乐雪碧</div><div class="price">4元/杯</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">酸萝卜</div><div class="price">2元/份</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">粗薯条</div><div class="price">6元/份</div></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:11px;color:#7a7269;margin-top:6px">汉堡+饮料套餐卖18元，比单买省1块，学生党最爱这种划算</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">对标项目 & 竞争优势</div>
  <div class="comp">
    <div class="comp-item"><span>华某士炸鸡汉堡</span><span class="tag adv">韩式炸鸡排</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">人家用的是碎肉压的排，你的是整块鸡腿肉</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>路边炸鸡柳卷饼</span><span class="tag adv">完整汉堡</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">他是小条肉丝，你是一整块大鸡排，视觉冲击不一样</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>便利店汉堡</span><span class="tag adv">现炸现做</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">他微波炉叮出来的，你是油锅里捞出来的，能比吗</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">销售话术（口语版）</div>
  <div class="copy-box">
    「帅哥美女，尝尝这个韩式鸡排堡——市面上你找不到第二家，整块鸡腿肉去骨腌了12个小时，你看看这上面的鳞片，炸得多漂亮。」<br>
    「一口下去那个脆啊，咔嚓咔嚓的，肉汁在嘴里爆开，比那些碎肉压的汉堡不知道高到哪里去了。」<br>
    「一个卖15块，成本都6块了，你就想想这个品质值不值？你吃那个华某士一个也不止这个价吧？」<br>
    「要不来个套餐？汉堡加饮料一共才18，省一块钱，我帮你配好。」<br>
    「你加我个微信，以后想吃提前说，我给你留一个，放学高峰期排长队你懂的。」
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">避坑指南</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 鸡腿肉必须去骨去干净，尤其是关节部位的小碎骨，用手摸着剃一遍。有学生吃到骨头渣子，你这摊位就完了，学校门口家长的嘴比什么都厉害</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 裹粉一定要用"粉-水-粉"工艺——第一遍裹干粉，沾水，再裹干粉，边裹边用力按压出鳞片。很多人图省事直接裹一遍然后抖一抖，炸出来就是光板皮，毫无卖相</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 下油锅之后千万别翻动！鸡排刚进油锅时鳞片还没定型，你一翻那个鳞片全塌了，炸出来像面饼。等它自己浮起来再翻面，大约1分半到2分钟的事</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 汉堡坯一定要在扒炉或平底锅上加热一下，两面煎到微黄有焦痕。很多人偷懒用凉的汉堡坯，炸鸡排的热气把它一闷就软塌塌的，口感直接掉一半</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 沙拉酱别抹太多，抹薄薄一层就够了。酱多了会把鸡排的脆皮泡软，客人咬下去就不脆了，还腻。生菜洗干净一定要甩干水，湿哒哒的生菜也是脆皮杀手</div>
</div>

<div class="pay">
  <div class="lock-icon">🔒</div>
  <h3>¥39 解锁完整方案</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>完整配方（20倍摆摊量：60块鸡腿排量级）</li>
    <li>韩式原味腌料配比（精确到克的商用配方）</li>
    <li>起鳞粉调配比例 + 粉-水-粉手法视频详解</li>
    <li>油温控制标准：180℃炸5-6分钟时间对照表</li>
    <li>备料清单（一次备一周的量，不浪费）</li>
    <li>利润算盘（三档销量都算清了）</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="price-tag">¥39 <small>一次付费，永久查看</small></div>
  <a class="btn" href="#wechatSection" onclick="window.parent.scrollToWechat && window.parent.scrollToWechat()">📱 加微信购买</a>
  <div class="note">付款后微信发送完整文件</div>
</div>

<div class="ftr">沧林食品 · 食品创业决策系统</div>
